        "candidate_id": "C_10d0b3ac8696b303_0",
        "edit": "Replace the duplicated case item 3'd6 with 3'd7, assigning X<=0 and Y<=1, so the previously uncovered input 7 produces the expected output 01 instead of falling through to default 00.",
